# AIML Week 4 Evaluation & Production Pipeline

This repository contains implementations for model evaluation, regularisation, serialization, REST serving, capstone comparison, and responsible AI auditing.

## Setup Instructions

1. Create and activate a virtual environment:
   python -m venv .venv
   .venv\Scripts\activate

2. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

## Structure & Modules

- Day 1: Model Evaluation Metrics (Stratified K-Fold, ROC curve, learning curve)
- Day 2: Regularisation & Hyperparameter Search (Ridge L2 Grid Search, Lasso L1 Random Search)
- Day 3: Model Persistence (Joblib and Pickle serialization)
- Day 4: FastAPI Model Serving (Real-time REST endpoint inference)
- Day 5: 1M Capstone (Logistic Regression vs Random Forest text classification)
- Day 6: Responsible AI Auditing (AIF360 Disparate Impact mitigation and SHAP explainability)

